# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit picks <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the root one).
# The web image ships ONLY the prebuilt adapter-node bundle, so exclude everything and
# re-include the two paths it copies. Root .dockerignore excludes web/build; here it is
# the whole payload.
*
!web/build
!web/server.ts

# Never ship secrets or source maps' sibling env files even if they land in build/.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
